 "description": "List SQL procedures and functions in a library from QSYS2.SYSROUTINES, one row per specific routine, so overloads appear once each. Shows the type (procedure, scalar function, or table function), language, external program, SQL data access, result sets, and text. Use describe_routine for parameters and a call template. Uses the system's default schema if not provided.",
